# Tests for model.sem: every invariant of `buildModel` is verified below, on a
# small module and on sources it refuses.

modelTest is test
modelTest purpose "A module's entities are found by name, with their kinds and the rows they own; calls and regions stay out of the name map"
modelTest verifies buildModel groupsEntities
modelTest verifies buildModel namesEntities
modelTest typeParameter none
modelTest input none
modelTest output none
modelTest outputOwnedBy none
modelTest raises none
modelTest effect none
modelTest uses none
modelTest memoryHeap true
modelTest async false
modelTest maxRecursion none
modelTest label begin loopKind none
modelTest label begin within none
modelTest label lexXDone loopKind none
modelTest label lexXDone within none
modelTest label groupXDone loopKind none
modelTest label groupXDone within none
modelTest label modelXDone loopKind none
modelTest label modelXDone within none
modelTest label finddemoDone loopKind none
modelTest label finddemoDone within none
modelTest label findpointDone loopKind none
modelTest label findpointDone within none
modelTest label findmainDone loopKind none
modelTest label findmainDone within none
modelTest label refused loopKind none
modelTest label refused within none
modelTest let source String "# a comment line\ndemo is module\ndemo purpose \"A module to model\"\ndemo path demo\n\nPoint is record\nPoint field x Int64\n\nmain is operation\nmain input none\n\ngreet is call\ngreet in main\n\nscratch is region\nscratch in main\n" immutable
modelTest let refusedText String "the front end refused the source or a step failed" immutable
